#question(title: [Series are linear])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  Let $display(sum_(n = 0)^oo a_n)$ be a
  series. Let $c in RR$. Prove that
  - IF $display(sum_(n = 0)^oo a_n)$ is
    convergent.
  - THEN $display(sum_(n = 0)^oo (c a_n))$ is
    convergent and
    $display(sum_(n = 0)^oo (c a_n) = c [sum_(n = 0)^oo a_n] .)$

  #v(0.5cm)

  Write a proof directly from the definition
  of series.
]
